stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending_tutor: student.request [active Match, valid availability, free recurring schedule]
    pending_tutor --> confirmed: tutor.pay_success [assigned tutor, hold active, recurrence rechecked]
    pending_tutor --> pending_tutor: tutor.pay_failed / record failed attempt
    pending_tutor --> rejected: tutor.reject [assigned tutor, hold active] / cancel pending fee
    pending_tutor --> expired: clock.tick or list.read [now >= expiresAt] / cancel pending fee
    confirmed --> confirmed: repeated successful payment / return confirmed result
    rejected --> [*]
    expired --> [*]

    note right of pending_tutor
        One recurring class per Booking
        Weekdays + hours + effective date range
        Hold up to REQUEST_HOLD_HOURS (default 24h)
        Deadline capped at first lesson
        Sorted student and tutor row locks
    end note

    note right of confirmed
        Tutor pays one acceptance fee for the class
        One unique Transaction per Booking
        Tuition agreed and paid outside MindMatch
        PaymentEvent deduplicates each attempt
    end note
